ting protocols. PRISM is the diagnostic algebra (measures loops over time). PULSE is the temporal algebra (declares how loops cycle). OS-011 (Embodiment) is the sensorimotor behavioral protocol for "},{"id":"spn-102648","marks":["code"],"text":"&body.*"},{"id":"spn-102649","text":" providers — closes the perception-action gap by defining the typed "},{"id":"spn-102650","marks":["code"],"text":"perceive/act/affordances/encode_state/replay"},{"id":"spn-102651","text":" loop. Together with the eight cognitive primitives (OS-001 through OS-008) and the [&] structural composition layer, they form the complete protocol stack."}]},{"id":"blk-71582","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-102652","text":"Separate spec documents"}]},{"id":"blk-71583","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-71585","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-102653","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/OS-008-HARNESS.md"},{"id":"spn-102654","text":" — Agent Harness Protocol (pipeline enforcement, quality gates, sprint contracts, context management)"}]}],"id":"blk-71584","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-71587","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-102655","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/OS-009-PRISM-SPECIFICATION.md"},{"id":"spn-102656","text":" — PRISM Protocol for Rating Iterative System Memory (9 CL dimensions, 4-phase evaluation loop, BYOR, IRT calibration)"}]}],"id":"blk-71586","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-71589","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-102657","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/OS-010-PULSE-SPECIFICATION.md"},{"id":"spn-102658","text":" — PULSE Protocol for Uniform Loop State Exchange (loop manifest schema, 5 canonical phase kinds, 6 canonical tokens as of v0.1.1, 7 invariants, BYOL)"}]}],"id":"blk-71588","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-71591","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-102659","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/OS-011-EMBODIMENT.md"},{"id":"spn-102660","text":" — Embodiment Protocol (typed perceive/act/affordances/encode_state/replay loop for "},{"id":"spn-102661","marks":["code"],"text":"&body.*"},{"id":"spn-102662","text":", InteractionTrace schema, SurpriseSignal PULSE token, 5 invariants, 12 conformance tests)"}]}],"id":"blk-71590","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-71593","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-102663","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/OS-E001-EMPIRICAL-EVALUATION.md"},{"id":"spn-102664","text":" — Empirical Evaluation of Topology-Aware Continual Learning (Graphonomous benchmark on [&] portfolio)"}]}],"id":"blk-71592","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-71594","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-102665","text":"Relationship to other projects"}]},{"id":"blk-71595","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-71597","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-102666","text":"OpenSentience defines the theoretical protocols; [&] portfolio companies implement them"}]}],"id":"blk-71596","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-71599","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-102667","text":"Graphonomous implements OS-001 (continual learning) and is the canonical PULSE substrate for "},{"id":"spn-102668","marks":["code"],"text":"memory"}]}],"id":"blk-71598","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-71601","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-102669","text":"AmpersandBoxDesign implements OS-002 through OS-005 as prompts and contracts"}]}],"id":"blk-71600","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-71603","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-102670","text":"Delegatic implements OS-006 (governance) and is the canonical PULSE substrate for "},{"id":"spn-102671","marks":["code"],"text":"policy"},{"id":"spn-102672","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-102673","marks":["code"],"text":"audit"}]}],"id":"blk-71602","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-71605","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-102674","text":"OS-008 (Harness) sits above OS-006 — enforces pipeline ordering, quality gates, and governance contracts at runtime"}]}],"id":"blk-71604","kind":"list-item"},{